&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience managing global or multi-country payroll operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in international payroll compliance across APAC and EMEA jurisdictions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading distributed teams and partnering with global payroll vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of payroll controls, audit requirements, and SOX-compliant processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage complex operational priorities and collaborate effectively across cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;While it&#39;s not required, it&#39;s an added plus if you also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operated in a high-growth technology or SaaS environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supported international expansion or new market entry initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managed equity, mobility, or expatriate payroll programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilized Workday, ADP, and global payroll platforms to support payroll operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Led vendor consolidation or global process standardization initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
