mbaexchange-bayada:greenhouse:8104652002.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discover Rewarding Work as a CNA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care has an immediate need for&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;CNAs&lt;/strong&gt; to care for our clients in the &lt;strong&gt;Apex&lt;/strong&gt; area. As a member of our home care team, you will be valued, respected, and heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weekly Pay - $16-17 an hour and OT available&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quick Hiring Process!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1:1 Patient Ratio!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA offers:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weekly pay (Work this week and get paid the next Thursday!)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible scheduling&amp;nbsp;to fit your lifestyle using scheduling app&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Short commute times – we try to match you to opportunities near your home&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Positive work environment and the tools you need to do your job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Eligible for any of BAYADA’s group medical, prescription drug, dental, and vision benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;if you work an average of 30 hours per week&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To learn more about BAYADA Benefits,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bayada.com/benefits/&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scholarship programs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A stable working environment – we invest in our care team&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid time off&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health, dental, and vision insurance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;401k&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;24/7 on call clinical manager support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We have current job openings in the following locations:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raleigh&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
