&lt;li&gt;Positive work culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible scheduling based on your preferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PTO&lt;/li&gt;
